{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e13-scene-09",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "我只希望我们能够珍惜现在  (I Only Hope We Can Cherish the Present)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "xin_huimei": "辛惠美",
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔",
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "After the broadcast, Chun Yuqiao returns to Xin Huimei ready to tell her everything about his past, and Bu Xiaogu visits Huimei the next day so no misunderstanding lingers. Listen to Xin Huimei, Chun Yuqiao, and Xiaogu in Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "是你？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "虽然我不知道你为什么道歉，不过我原谅你。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我过去的事情，你应该知道。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我都告诉你。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "请进。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你好。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "是你啊，有什么事吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这就是我前两天的见闻。淳于总的过去有过洛琳，有过钟阳子，现在都已经不在他的生活里了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我总是觉得，我应该告诉你。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "我不需要知道什么，我只希望我们能够珍惜现在。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这是原创策划，按规定是不能给别人看的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这个是淳于乔做的原创策划！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "是你？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It's you?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "虽然我不知道你为什么道歉，不过我原谅你。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Even though I don't know what the roses are apologizing for, I forgive you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我过去的事情，你应该知道。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Everything about my past — you deserve to know it.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我都告诉你。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I'll tell you all of it.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "请进。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Come on in.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你好。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hello.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "是你啊，有什么事吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Oh, it's you — is there something on your mind?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这就是我前两天的见闻。淳于总的过去有过洛琳，有过钟阳子，现在都已经不在他的生活里了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'That's what I witnessed overseas these past two days: Luo Lin and Zhong Yangzi were chapters of Mr Chun Yu's past, and neither is in his life anymore.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我总是觉得，我应该告诉你。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I kept feeling that you ought to hear it firsthand.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "我不需要知道什么，我只希望我们能够珍惜现在。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I don't need to dig into anything anymore — I only hope the two of us can cherish the present.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这是原创策划，按规定是不能给别人看的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'This folder is a confidential original show proposal; company rules say outsiders aren't allowed a peek.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这个是淳于乔做的原创策划！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'This is an original show concept created by Chun Yuqiao himself!'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "是你？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "虽然我不知道你为什么道歉，不过我原谅你。",
      "gap": 0.5
