    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "我不需要知道什么，我只希望我们能够珍惜现在。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这是原创策划，按规定是不能给别人看的。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这个是淳于乔做的原创策划！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Choosing to cherish the present rather than dwell on old chapters, Huimei puts the past to rest—while back at Xingtian, Xiaogu pores excitedly over Yuqiao's confidential original show blueprint. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "明天见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
